B.apJ=new A.fF("The Service","StockLyte is a multi-tenant inventory management application that lets an organization track products, stock levels, locations, stock movements, and team access. Each organization's data is kept in its own isolated database schema and is not visible to, or accessible from, any other organization using StockLyte.")
B.aq0=new A.fF("Free Trial","New organizations receive a 15-day free trial with no credit card required. During the trial you have full access to the features included in your plan. If the trial ends without a plan being arranged, access is paused \u2014 your data is not deleted and will be available again as soon as access is restored.")
B.aq1=new A.fF("Accounts & Roles","You must provide accurate registration information and keep your login credentials confidential. The person who signs up an organization becomes its first Admin and may invite additional team members under roles (Admin, Manager, Staff, Viewer) that control what they can see and do. You are responsible for the actions taken under accounts you create within your organization.")
B.aq3=new A.fF("Subscriptions & Billing","StockLyte does not currently process payments in-app. Paid plans, pricing, and billing arrangements are agreed directly with Impacgo by contacting info@impacgo.com. Suspending, reactivating, or extending an organization's access is handled manually by our team once billing is arranged.")
B.apK=new A.fF("Acceptable Use","You agree not to: use StockLyte for any unlawful purpose; attempt to access another organization's data or bypass tenant isolation; probe, scan, or interfere with the security of the service; reverse-engineer or resell the platform without our written permission; or upload content you do not have the right to store.")
B.apO=new A.fF("Your Data","You retain ownership of the business data you enter into StockLyte (products, stock records, team information, and similar). We process that data solely to provide the service to you and do not use it for any other purpose. See our Privacy Policy for details on what we collect and how it is handled.")
B.apP=new A.fF("Suspension & Termination","We may suspend or terminate access for non-payment, breach of these Terms, or suspected misuse. You may stop using StockLyte at any time. If your account is inactive or suspended for an extended period, we will make reasonable efforts to notify you before permanently deleting your organization's data.")
B.aq2=new A.fF("Third-Party Services","StockLyte relies on third-party infrastructure providers \u2014 including Supabase for authentication and database hosting, and an email provider for transactional messages \u2014 to operate the service. Their own terms and security practices apply to the infrastructure they provide.")
B.apM=new A.fF("Disclaimers & Limitation of Liability",'StockLyte is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. To the maximum extent permitted by law, Impacgo is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the service, including loss of data or business interruption.')
B.apL=new A.fF("Changes to These Terms",'We may update these Terms from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of StockLyte after changes take effect means you accept the revised Terms.')
B.apY=new A.fF("Governing Law","These Terms are governed by the laws of India, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.")
B.apS=new A.fF("Contact","Questions about these Terms can be sent to info@impacgo.com.")
